flowchart LR
  dev[Разработчик] --> git[GitLab project platform/deployment-kit]
  git --> pipe[GitLab CI pipeline]
  pipe --> validate[validate: lint, syntax, tests]
  pipe --> build[build: API, Gateway, Frontend]
  build --> registry[GitLab Container Registry]
  pipe --> deploy[deploy: Helm upgrade]
  registry --> deploy
  deploy --> k8s[Kubernetes app namespace]
  k8s --> smoke[post-deploy tests]
  smoke --> reports[JSON/HTML reports]
